  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spores can infest a corpse and animate it. If a Small or Medium Beast or Humanoid dies within 10 feet of you, you can take a Reaction to animate it: it stands up immediately with 1 Hit Point, using the Zombie stat block of the Monster Manual. It remains animate for 1 hour, then collapses and dies. In combat, the zombie acts immediately after you; it obeys your mental commands, and the only action it can take is the Attack action, making one melee attack. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
